WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.187
The world is watching.

00:00:02.137 --> 00:00:09.587
The United Nations Committee on the Rights of Persons with Disabilities has called on Canada to repeal Track 2 entirely.

00:00:09.587 --> 00:00:11.675
Extreme concern.

00:00:11.675 --> 00:00:15.425
10 provinces oppose the mental illness expansion.

00:00:15.425 --> 00:00:18.537
2 Charter challenges before the courts.

00:00:18.537 --> 00:00:25.000
Veteran Kelsi Sheren testified 20 veterans have proof of being offered MAID when seeking healthcare.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.875
Canada's response to all of it: no plans to act.
